// PSS v3.0 LRM — Example 237: Name resolution to declaration in nested namespace (page 320)
package P1 {
 struct s {};
};
package P2 {
 struct s {};
  component C1 {
   import P1::*;
    struct s {};
   s f;
  };
};

In Example 238, s is declared in two places: imported package P1 and encapsulating package P2. The s
referenced in nested component C1 is resolved to the s defined in imported package P1. Using qualifiers,
